Package: fvfm
Type: Package
Title: FvFm Leaf Disc Fluorescence Analysis Pipeline
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Josef", "Garen", role = "aut"),
    person("Pieter", "Arnold", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "piet.arnold@gmail.com")
  )
Description: R wrapper around a Python pipeline for semi-automated analysis of
    leaf disc fluorescence images from a Walz ImagingPAM fluorometer. Computes
    Fv/Fm = (Fm - Fo) / Fm for each leaf disc and exports results to CSV.
    All image processing and GUI interactions are handled by the bundled Python
    backend (OpenCV, scikit-image). The user interacts via native GUI windows
    that appear alongside RStudio.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    reticulate
Suggests:
    remotes
SystemRequirements: Python (>= 3.9)
